                        "target_lang_word": "подножие",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "подножие",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bf85c4b-5236-3bca-a677-877b98ef3e3a",
                                        "entry_id": "17b067d3-beb1-3566-9162-10fe535629c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "место у самого основания чего-либо высокого (горы, памятника и т. п.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "719087f4-afd7-47b4-a81a-aeac8ab14a7e",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf85c4b-5236-3bca-a677-877b98ef3e3a",
                                                "text": "В болотах завязшие горы, // В подножиях гор ― облака."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a1b01cf-d8cd-4cf1-83b2-13a56d5cabff",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf85c4b-5236-3bca-a677-877b98ef3e3a",
                                                "text": "Так, например, терригенный турбидный поток проходит от края шельфа через подводный каньон до глубоководного конуса выноса континентального подножия и далее растекается по абиссальной равнине, отлагая дистальные турбидиты."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62e1a74c-6962-3808-9f74-6b7f67631612",
                                        "entry_id": "17b067d3-beb1-3566-9162-10fe535629c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "устар. то же, что пьедестал"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a0a987d-ac79-41a1-8245-9c2e289bd3bc",
                                                "sense_id": "62e1a74c-6962-3808-9f74-6b7f67631612",
                                                "text": "Кругом подножия кумира // Безумец бедный обошёл // И взоры дикие навёл // На лик державца полумира."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9c15bc5-b9d2-4d60-a159-cd29cb6fe8ce",
                                                "sense_id": "62e1a74c-6962-3808-9f74-6b7f67631612",
                                                "text": "Когда была воздвигнута колонна в память Александру I, она крепко запретила кучеру своему возить её в близости колонны: «Не ровён час, — говорила она, — пожалуй, и свалится она с подножия своего»."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f97ba58-666a-3af3-bfe0-7a8cfc553cf5",
                                        "entry_id": "17b067d3-beb1-3566-9162-10fe535629c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "подставка для ног"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7f6802b-c4c9-3f28-974f-0225c7874fc3",
                                        "entry_id": "17b067d3-beb1-3566-9162-10fe535629c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "устар. коврик, подстилаемый под ноги лиц, над которыми производится обряд венчания; подножка"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3001a5cf-75db-48d0-905b-660ed35b94a3",
                                                "sense_id": "e7f6802b-c4c9-3f28-974f-0225c7874fc3",
                                                "text": "Варенька первая вступила на подножие, но свеча её сгорела больше, чем у жениха."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "57976a12-6d61-4450-a205-7017881f53bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "15c41332-19d3-34f1-b54e-961911d6c7f6",
                        "source_sense_description": "en géologie",
                        "target_lang_word": "bedrock",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bedrock",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3d56441-fbb8-39cb-b790-7627158fefb3",
                                        "entry_id": "9242e3bd-40df-3069-a484-54eba41b2ab5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The solid rock found at some depth below the ground surface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8778a0b6-e312-45af-83b5-16059d3aab07",
                                                "sense_id": "b3d56441-fbb8-39cb-b790-7627158fefb3",
                                                "text": "The denudation of the land was upon a grand scale. All superficial accumulations were swept away, and the bedrock was exposed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc215049-f6c7-41b6-944b-2a6b6289f6f8",
                                                "sense_id": "b3d56441-fbb8-39cb-b790-7627158fefb3",
                                                "text": "Listen! It's big. Only eight to twenty feet to bedrock. There won't be a claim that don't run to half a million."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74db49da-d9be-370a-a3e0-006e045188f1",
                                        "entry_id": "9242e3bd-40df-3069-a484-54eba41b2ab5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A basis or foundation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afd381dd-800c-4aed-9606-86f2cd749059",
                                                "sense_id": "74db49da-d9be-370a-a3e0-006e045188f1",
                                                "text": "If culture is the bedrock of a society, then language is the cornerstone of culture."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34b1ec6f-26dd-4e3e-b722-41acfa2c251a",
                                                "sense_id": "74db49da-d9be-370a-a3e0-006e045188f1",
                                                "text": "Now, although like most young people, Godfrey was indolent and evasive of difficulties, fearful of facing troubles also, he had a bedrock of character."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dfcdc3e-63ae-485c-a56e-daa208cf14f4",
                                                "sense_id": "74db49da-d9be-370a-a3e0-006e045188f1",
                                                "text": "Many of the bedrock assumptions of American culture — about work, progress, fairness and optimism — are being shaken as successive generations worry about the prospect of declining living standards."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b100e85-d699-4cf9-86e2-0815d5a59467",
                                                "sense_id": "74db49da-d9be-370a-a3e0-006e045188f1",
                                                "text": "The research on the Like button was an example of how Facebook has questioned the bedrock features of social networking."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e70a760-a734-464e-98ef-9d3e6ba9474f",
                                                "sense_id": "74db49da-d9be-370a-a3e0-006e045188f1",
                                                "text": "Above all, rail needs to be boring. By that, I mean that it must run its timetable reliably, day-in and day-out. Punctuality and reliability remain the bedrock of a successful railway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3723395b-c591-3a00-b5fd-0a7f274eb14a",
                                        "entry_id": "9242e3bd-40df-3069-a484-54eba41b2ab5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The bones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bedrock",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2200f446-c17b-348b-8f1f-9be104315261",
                                        "entry_id": "a6ac5803-94c8-30e3-a0c1-3f4c62ba0317",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To establish on a solid foundation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dab6263-b9d7-44d2-b6c5-047b5c4a7bc0",
                                                "sense_id": "2200f446-c17b-348b-8f1f-9be104315261",
                                                "text": "Bedrocked in the formative race relations of the Heart of Dixie, the governor declined an invitation to the unveiling of artist Maya Lin's civil rights memorial in downtown Montgomery."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
